# Architecture

- Keep **Orbital Core** (`src/brain/`, pure celebrations helpers) free of `vscode` imports
- Platform code (`extension.ts`, triggers, host, webviews) adapts IDE events → normalized signals
- Prefer: **signal → outcome candidates → interruption policy → decision** over logic in event handlers
- New experiences register via an experience contract (see skill `orbital-experience`); do not bypass brain/policy hard constraints
- Dispose all subscriptions; no leaked timers/watchers
- Cross-cutting changes (signals, persistence, network, scheduling): consult `orbital-architect` before large edits
